WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.612
Deep networks memorize training data, which matters
for generalization,

00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:06.991
noisy learning, and privacy leakage.

00:00:07.071 --> 00:00:12.343
Feldman's memorization score quantifies this
rigorously but is far too expensive.

00:00:12.423 --> 00:00:16.176
Input loss curvature, the trace of the input-loss Hessian,

00:00:16.256 --> 00:00:19.678
tracks memorization roughly a thousand times cheaper,

00:00:19.758 --> 00:00:22.322
yet the connection was purely empirical,

00:00:22.402 --> 00:00:25.890
with no theory linking either to differential privacy.
